  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP - Sukhumi P4</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP - Sukhumi P4</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP har efterfr&#xe5;gat Sida att finansiera en programchef f&#xf6;r en EU-finansierad insats i utbrytarrepubliken Abchazien, Georgien, kallad &quot;Abkhazia Livelihood Improvement and Recovery&quot;. Finansiering sker i form av en svensk sekundering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP has requested Sida to finance a program maneger for the EC funded programme &quot;Abkhazia Livelihood Improvement and Recovery&quot; (ALIR) in Georgia,through a Swedish secondment.</narrative>
  </description>
